 "notes": [
  "No objective; the strategy says to start Yavin 4: Massassi Throne Room with Heading For The Medical Frigate, Insurrection & Aim High and two of Your Insight Serves You Well & Staging Areas, Squadron Assignments and Don't Do That Again. All are in the posted sections and count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'EPP Luke / Obi-Wan / Qui-Gon / Leia' dested Luke With Lightsaber, Obi-Wan With Lightsaber, Qui-Gon Jinn With Lightsaber and Leia With Blaster Rifle. Qui-Gon Jinn With Lightsaber is a Theed Palace card (released after this post); kept as posted.",
  "Posted 'Coruscant docking bay' dested the Light Coruscant-set Coruscant: Docking Bay; 'Y4 Throne Room' dested Yavin 4: Massassi Throne Room; 'Schmi Skywalker' dested Shmi Skywalker; '3PO w/ Parts Showing' dested Threepio With His Parts Showing.",
  "Posted 'Sense' and 'Alter' (no set) dested the Light Premiere cards.",
  "Posted 'Darklighter Spin/AWRI' dested All Wings Report In & Darklighter Spin; 'YISYW/Staging Areas' dested Your Insight Serves You Well & Staging Areas; 'SATM/Blaster Proficiency' and 'Houjix/Out of Nowhere' dested as the combo Interrupts; 'Jedi's Resilience' dested A Jedi's Resilience.",
  "Don't Do That Again is posted under Effects and dested as the Tatooine Effect, not the Reflections III Defensive Shield (the author: 'you can't use the sideboard card, but you can still use the original')."
 ],
